msgstr ""
"During script execution, all process variables visible in the current "
"scope are available."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:70
msgid ""
"``documentRef`` - строковое представление entityRef документа |br| "
"``documentType`` - id типа документа |br| ``lastTaskCompletor`` - "
"username пользователя, который завершил последнюю задачу |br| ``comment``"
" - комментарий из последней завершенной задачи |br| ``workflowInitiator``"
" - username инициатора БП |br|"
msgstr ""
"``documentRef`` - string representation of the document's entityRef |br| "
"``documentType`` - document type id |br| ``lastTaskCompletor`` - username"
" of the user who completed the last task |br| ``comment`` - comment from "
"the last completed task |br| ``workflowInitiator`` - username of the BP "
"initiator |br|"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:79
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "Execution"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:81
msgid ""
"``execution`` - переменная, которая всегда доступна, если скрипт "
"выполняется в области выполнения (например, в Script Task). "
"`(DelegateExecution) <https://docs.camunda.org/javadoc/camunda-bpm-"
"platform/7.17/org/camunda/bpm/engine/delegate/DelegateExecution.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"``execution`` - a variable that is always available if the script is "
"executed in an execution scope (e.g., in a Script Task). "
"`(DelegateExecution) <https://docs.camunda.org/javadoc/camunda-bpm-"
"platform/7.17/org/camunda/bpm/engine/delegate/DelegateExecution.html>`_"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:92
msgid "Document"
msgstr "Document"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:94
msgid ""
"``document`` - является скриптовым представлением документа "
"`AttValueScriptCtx <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-records/blob/master"
"/ecos-"
"records/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/records3/record/atts/computed/script/AttValueScriptCtx.kt>`_"
" , по которому идет БП."
msgstr ""
"``document`` - is the script representation of the document "
"`AttValueScriptCtx <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-records/blob/master"
"/ecos-"
"records/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/records3/record/atts/computed/script/AttValueScriptCtx.kt>`_"
" for which the BP is running."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:112
msgid "Records"
msgstr "Records"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:114
msgid ""
"``Records`` - сервис, который предоставляет доступ к функциям работы с "
"рекордами `RecordsScriptService <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"records/blob/master/ecos-"
"records/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/records3/record/atts/computed/script/RecordsScriptService.kt>`_."
msgstr ""
"``Records`` - is a service that provides access to record functions "
"`RecordsScriptService <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-records/blob/master"
"/ecos-"
"records/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/records3/record/atts/computed/script/RecordsScriptService.kt>`_."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:142
msgid "ECOS Config"
msgstr "ECOS Config"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:144
msgid ""
"``Config`` - предоставляет доступ к Конфигурации Citeck по ключу в "
"формате ``<область>$<идентификатор>``."
msgstr ""
"``Config`` - provides access to Citeck Configuration by key in the format"
" ``<scope>$<identifier>``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:146
msgid "``get(key: String): DataValue`` - получение значения по ключу"
msgstr "``get(key: String): DataValue`` - get value by key"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:147
msgid ""
"``getOrDefault(key: String, defaultValue: Any): DataValue`` - получение "
"значения по ключу, если значение не найдено, то возвращается значение по "
"умолчанию"
msgstr ""
"``getOrDefault(key: String, defaultValue: Any): DataValue`` - get value "
"by key, if the value is not found, the default value is returned"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:148
msgid ""
"``getNotNull(key: String): DataValue`` - получение значения по ключу, "
"если значение null, то выбрасывается исключение"
msgstr ""
"``getNotNull(key: String): DataValue`` - get value by key, if the value "
"is null, an exception is thrown"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:159
msgid "DataValue"
msgstr "DataValue"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:161
msgid ""
"``DataValue`` - объект, позволяющий сконвертировать данные в структуру "
"`BpmnDataValue <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"process/blob/master/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/engine/camunda/impl/variables/convert/BpmnDataValue.kt>`_"
" для удобной работы с json представлением, это позволяет безопасно "
"обращаться к полям, получать значения по умолчанию, приводить к нужному "
"типу, сохранять данные в execution и многое другое, подробнее см. методы "
"класса."
msgstr ""
"``DataValue`` - an object that allows converting data into the structure "
"`BpmnDataValue <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"process/blob/master/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/engine/camunda/impl/variables/convert/BpmnDataValue.kt>`_"
" for convenient work with JSON representation; it allows safely accessing"
" fields, getting default values, casting to the desired type, saving data"
" in execution, and much more. For more details, see the class methods."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:163
msgid ""
"``DataValue.of(content: Any?)`` - создает объект DataValue из любого "
"объекта, если объект не может быть сконвертирован в DataValue, то "
"возвращается пустой объект DataValue."
msgstr ""
"``DataValue.of(content: Any?)`` - creates a DataValue object from any "
"object; if the object cannot be converted to DataValue, an empty "
"DataValue object is returned."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:164
msgid "``DataValue.createObj()`` - создает пустой объект DataValue."
msgstr "``DataValue.createObj()`` - creates an empty DataValue object."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:165
msgid "``DataValue.createArr()`` - создает пустой массив DataValue."
msgstr "``DataValue.createArr()`` - creates an empty DataValue array."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:166
msgid ""
"``DataValue.createStr(value: Any?)`` - создает строковое представление "
"переданного значения."
msgstr ""
"``DataValue.createStr(value: Any?)`` - creates a string representation of"
" the passed value."

