msgid "Результат:"
msgstr "Result:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:239
msgid "Time и Duration. Работа с датами и временными интервалами"
msgstr "Time and Duration. Working with dates and time intervals"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:241
msgid ""
"При работе с датами и временными интервалами рекомендуется использовать "
"объекты ``Time`` и ``Duration``."
msgstr ""
"When working with dates and time intervals, it is recommended to use the "
"``Time`` and ``Duration`` objects."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:243
msgid ""
"``Time`` - объект, упрощающий работу с датами, позволяющий сохранять дату"
" в execution процесса, добавлять к дате календарное/рабочее время на "
"основе рабочего расписания, получать разницу между двумя датами и многое "
"другое. Подробнее см. примеры."
msgstr ""
"``Time`` - an object that simplifies working with dates, allowing to save"
" a date in the process execution, add calendar/working time to a date "
"based on the work schedule, get the difference between two dates, and "
"much more. See examples for more details."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:245
msgid ""
"``Duration`` - объект, упрощающий работу с временными интервалами. "
"Поддерживается сохранение в execution процесса."
msgstr ""
"``Duration`` - an object that simplifies working with time intervals. "
"Saving to process execution is supported."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:247
msgid "Примеры использования:"
msgstr "Usage examples:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:337
msgid ""
"Сохранение объекта javascript Date в execution процесса не "
"поддерживается. Для работы с датами и временными интервалами используйте "
"объекты ``Time`` и ``Duration``."
msgstr ""
"Saving a javascript Date object to process execution is not supported. "
"Use the ``Time`` and ``Duration`` objects for working with dates and time"
" intervals."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:341
msgid "WebUrl"
msgstr "WebUrl"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:343
msgid "``webUrl`` — переменная возвращает настроенный веб url сервера"
msgstr "``webUrl`` — variable returns the configured web URL of the server"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:346
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr "Tasks"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:348
msgid "``tasks`` — сервис для манипуляций над задачами."
msgstr "``tasks`` — service for manipulating tasks."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:350
msgid ""
"``completeActiveTasks(execution: DelegateExecution)`` - завершает все "
"активные задачи по инстансу процесса из "
"[DelegateExecution.getProcessInstanceId]. Задачи завершаются с "
"результатом *defaultDone: Выполнено*."
msgstr ""
"``completeActiveTasks(execution: DelegateExecution)`` - completes all "
"active tasks for the process instance from "
"[DelegateExecution.getProcessInstanceId]. Tasks are completed with the "
"result *defaultDone: Completed*."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:354
msgid "Templated content"
msgstr "Templated content"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:356
msgid "``templatedContent`` — сервис для работы с шаблонизированным контентом."
msgstr "``templatedContent`` — service for working with templated content."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:358
msgid ""
"``write(record: String, template: String)`` - генерирует контент по "
"указанному шаблону [`template`], на основе данных рекорда [`record`] и "
"записывает сгенерированный контент в [`record`] в атрибут контент по "
"умолчанию `content`."
msgstr ""
"``write(record: String, template: String)`` - generates content based on "
"the specified template [`template`], using record data [`record`], and "
"writes the generated content to the [`record`] in the default content "
"attribute `content`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:359
msgid ""
"``write(record: String, template: String, attribute: String)`` - "
"генерирует контент по указанному шаблону `[template`], на основе данных "
"рекорда [`record`] и записывает сгенерированный контент в [`record`] в "
"переданный атрибут [`attribute`]."
msgstr ""
"``write(record: String, template: String, attribute: String)`` - "
"generates content based on the specified template [`template`], using "
"record data [`record`], and writes the generated content to the "
"[`record`] in the specified attribute [`attribute`]."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:361
msgid ""
"В качестве [`template`] можно передать строковое представление EntityRef "
"шаблона или его id."
msgstr ""
"As [`template`], you can pass the string representation of the template's"
" EntityRef or its id."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:364
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Events"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:366
msgid ""
"``events`` — сервис для работы с :ref:`событиями Citeck "
"<ecos_bpmn_events>`."
msgstr ""
"``events`` — service for working with :ref:`Citeck events "
"<ecos_bpmn_events>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:368
msgid ""
"``send(type: String, data: BpmnDataValue)`` - отправляет событие с "
"указанным типом (именем) и данными."
msgstr ""
"``send(type: String, data: BpmnDataValue)`` - sends an event with the "
"specified type (name) and data."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:370
msgid "Например, можно отправить Citeck событие через скрипт:"
msgstr "For example, you can send a Citeck event via a script:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:381
msgid ""
"И подписаться на него в bpmn event через ручную настройку с \"test-"
"topic\" или программно через слушателя:"
msgstr ""
"And subscribe to it in a bpmn event via manual configuration with \"test-"
"topic\" or programmatically via a listener:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:398
msgid "Logger"
msgstr "Logger"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:400
msgid ""
"``log`` — логгер, пишет в микросервис ecos-process, дополнительно "
"выводится информация о execution. Для настройки уровня логирования "
"используется класс "
"``ru.citeck.ecos.process.domain.bpmn.engine.camunda.services.beans.ScriptLogger``."
" |br| Поддерживаемые методы:"
msgstr ""
"``log`` — logger, writes to the ecos-process microservice, additionally "
"outputs execution information. The class "
"``ru.citeck.ecos.process.domain.bpmn.engine.camunda.services.beans.ScriptLogger``"
" is used to configure the logging level. |br| Supported methods:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:402
msgid "``log.info(message: String)``"
msgstr "``log.info(message: String)``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:403
msgid "``log.warn(message: String)``"
msgstr "``log.warn(message: String)``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:404
msgid "``log.error(message: String)``"
msgstr "``log.error(message: String)``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_script_task.rst:405
msgid "``log.debug(message: String)``"
msgstr "``log.debug(message: String)``"

